    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "When you see your wife, someone you've been married to for 40 years, standing up on that stage, what is it about her that you want people to know? I mean, and personally, not just policy, not exactly what she's going to do as president, but what is it about her as a person that you want people to know?",
