  {
    "episode_id": 90613,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90613.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Something that people keep asking me since I started doing this and got to know her a little bit, people keep asking me this question, which I think is actually a really problematic question. I think it's a question that a man running for president wouldn't get. But the question is, why is she running? As though there's some secret motive. And before we talk to that, I was thinking maybe I could ask you why you think she's running.",
