    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90613.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 41,
    "turn_text": "and All right, I'm convinced, I'm convinced. I have one more question for you, and then I'll let you go. I want to ask you about optimism. How do you stay optimistic in a world that can be this cynical? And how have you and your wife stayed as optimistic as you need to be to run for president?",
